r predicted that she would give birth to an excellent heir, and so she was chosen as one of the pregnant maids. She was promised that if she could successfully give birth to an heir, the revival of her family's fortunes would be ensured, and although she is reluctant, she has accepted her fate for the sake of her family. She has a high level of pride, but is easily hurt."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c147030"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元お嬢様メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"良家の令嬢だったが、実家が潰れて没落中の身（天空院家に潰された？）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ＡＩ・Ｄｅｍｅｔｅｒによって優秀な跡継ぎを産めると見込まれ、孕みメイドの一人に選ばれた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無事跡継ぎを産めば実家の再興を約束されており、嫌々ながらも、家族のために運命を受け入れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プライドは高いが、打たれ弱い一面も……"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27199","sourceWorkId":"37471","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元お嬢様メイド。 良家の令嬢だったが、実家が潰れて没落中の身（天空院家に潰された？）。 ＡＩ・Ｄｅｍｅｔｅｒによって優秀な跡継ぎを産めると見込まれ、孕みメイドの一人に選ばれた。 無事跡継ぎを産めば実家の再興を約束されており、嫌々ながらも、家族のために運命を受け入れている。 プライドは高いが、打たれ弱い一面も……"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"167533"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/947ae42ffc667e532346a8864dec0b2863500a4cbd6ce0fa5326c21b56fd34dc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/798bc19ae87ef97d59200ea3ffc40ae0aae50c61b7c26b9c3ba294c7947a4071.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"叶一華","creatorId":"vndb:s16232","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s16232","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s16232","name":"叶一華","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:526224:167533:33030:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c147032","characterName":"諏訪 燈子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"167532","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"526224"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27198"],"vndbCharacterId":"c147032"},"originalCharacterName":"諏訪 燈子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A beautiful, unfortunate maid. While the other maids are merely makeshift maids, she is a genuine maid who has served the Tenkuin family since she was a child. Alone in the world, she feels a deep sense of gratitude towards the head of the family, Yoichiro. By order, she is forced to entrust herself to the protagonist..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c147032"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"薄幸の美少女メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他の面々は付け焼き刃のなんちゃってメイドだが、幼い頃から天空院家に仕えてきた生粋の侍女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天涯孤独の身で、当主の与一郎に深い恩義を感じている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"命令により、やむなく主人公に身を任せることに……"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27198","sourceWorkId":"37471","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"薄幸の美少女メイド。 他の面々は付け焼き刃のなんちゃってメイドだが、幼い頃から天空院家に仕えてきた生粋の侍女。 天涯孤独の身で、当主の与一郎に深い恩義を感じている。 命令により、やむなく主人公に身を任せることに……"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"167532"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a170fbdb693ed5e5bdcc0c405bb2645cd32460f6cf126d010cad1d1632da1a52.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba045e310c20ec9e4d6ecd6137635c66f3e6933055c58ecb5775d72148f2d89d.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花月さや","creatorId":"vndb:s23345","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23345","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23345","name":"花月さや","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:526224:167532:40638:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c147035","characterName":"海原 ほたる","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"167535","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"526224"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27201"],"vndbCharacterId":"c147035"},"originalCharacterName":"海原 ほたる","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A beautiful maid with a sad face. She was on the verge of marrying her fiancé, but he was arrested on suspicion of embezzlement, leaving her at a loss. Then, the Tenkuin family offered her the job of becoming a pregnant maid in exchange for settling the situation. For the sake of her future with her fiancé, she reluctantly accepted and became a pregnant maid. After fulfilling her role, she hopes to forget everything and be united with her fiancé, but..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c147035"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"憂い顔の美女メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"婚約者と結婚寸前だったが、彼が横領容疑で逮捕されてしまい、途方に暮れていたところ、天空院家から事態の収拾と引き換えに孕みメイドになることを提案される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（この逮捕劇自体が天空院家の差し金？）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"婚約者との将来のため、泣く泣く受け入れて孕みメイドとなった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"役目を果たした後はすべてを忘れて、婚約者と結ばれたいと思っているが……"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27201","sourceWorkId":"37471","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"憂い顔の美女メイド。 婚約者と結婚寸前だったが、彼が横領容疑で逮捕されてしまい、途方に暮れていたところ、天空院家から事態の収拾と引き換えに孕みメイドになることを提案される。 婚約者との将来のため、泣く泣く受け入れて孕みメイドとなった。 役目を果たした後はすべてを忘れて、婚約者と結ばれたいと思っているが……"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"167535"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fcea94d1d67f4d147c75fed8d800048d3814789f8735242fa658dfc867c5eb14.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/t