急落、業界から姿を消した。 悶々としていたところを天空院家にスカウトされ、「無事に跡継ぎを産んだ後は芸能界復帰を全面サポートする」と提案され、受け入れた。 愛らしい外面と計算高い二面性を持つ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"167534"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2f/2fd9ffb0cb906a432602c470eafb1caf683bd0b7105848ef65f499f232dc58f1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70ee154d5fff8f27f1d9f82a2be1124728423fecf7d4795cdb7470987d160af7.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"乙倉由依","creatorId":"vndb:s26305","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s26305","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s26305","name":"乙倉ゆい(乙倉ゅい、乙倉由依、愛花むぎ)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:526224:167534:48849:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c155945","characterName":"天空院 与一郎","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"208366","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"526224"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27202"],"vndbCharacterId":"c155945"},"originalCharacterName":"天空院 与一郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the president of Tenkuin Trading and the head of the Tenkuin Group. He is the protagonist's long-lost father. He is quite elderly. Having lost his successors one after another, he is forced to entrust the protagonist with the task of conceiving an heir."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c155945"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"天空院商事の社長で、天空院グループの総帥でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の生き別れの父親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かなりの高齢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"跡継ぎを次々と失ったため、やむなく主人公に跡継ぎを孕ませる役目を託す。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacter